OL,3,GNEWSACommunity work earns charities top
OL,4,Ahonour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree charities in East Yorkshire and
OL,7,FLincolnshire have received awards for
OL,8,Ftheir outstanding community work.
OL,10,FHornsea First Aid Centre, M.A.S.H.
OL,11,FMilitary Assistance Social Hub and
OL,12,FLincolnshire Emergency Blood Bikes
OL,13,FService (LEBBS) have been recognised
OL,14,Fwith the King's Award for Voluntary
OL,15,FService.
OL,17,FA total of 250 volunteer-led groups
OL,18,Facross the UK have received the award
OL,19,Ffor their services, which is equivalent
OL,20,Fto an MBE.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
