OL,3,GNEWSACommunity work earns charities top
OL,4,Ahonour
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Martyn Lewis, the Chairman of the
OL,7,FKing's Award for Voluntary Service said
OL,8,Fthe groups were "three terrific winners
OL,9,Fwho are the very best of the
OL,10,Fcommunity".
